# ULTRON System Map

Stable pointers to where things live. Read this instead of grepping the repo.

## Memory layers
- L0 hot context: `~/.ultron/.tmp/context.md`
- L1 brain index: `~/.ultron/brain_index/index.db` (SQLite FTS5)
- L2 vault: `~/.ultron-vault/` (curated markdown)
- L3 remote (optional): git remote of the vault

## Code
- Cockpit Python tools: `~/.ultron/scripts/cockpit/`
- Hooks: `~/.ultron/scripts/hooks/`
- Skills: `~/.claude/skills/<name>/SKILL.md`
- Control Center (Tauri app): `~/.ultron/control-center/`

## Vector layer
Qdrant local at http://localhost:6333 — collections `ultron_vault`, `ultron_skills`.

## Personal area (gitignored, never published)
- `~/.ultron/personal/profile.md` — your free-form profile
- `~/.ultron/personal/known.json` — auto-generated style fingerprint

Customize this file as you add new paths to your workspace.
